sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Admin UI
    participant API as POST /credit
    participant TX as Transaction
    participant BE as billing_events
    participant T as tenants

    rect rgb(200,255,200)
    Note over UI,T: Normal Credit Request
    UI->>UI: Generate idempotency_key (UUID v4)
    UI->>API: POST {type, amount_xlm, idempotency_key: K}
    API->>API: Auth + role check
    API->>TX: BEGIN
    TX->>BE: SELECT WHERE tenant_id=X AND idempotency_key=K
    BE-->>TX: [] (empty)
    TX->>BE: INSERT (tenant_id, type, amount, key=K)
    TX->>T: UPDATE balance += amount
    TX-->>TX: COMMIT
    API-->>UI: 200 {newBalance, amountCredited}
    end

    rect rgb(255,255,200)
    Note over UI,T: Duplicate Request (safe retry)
    UI->>API: POST {same idempotency_key: K}
    API->>TX: BEGIN
    TX->>BE: SELECT WHERE idempotency_key=K
    BE-->>TX: [{id:42, amount:"100"}]
    TX->>T: SELECT balance (read-only)
    TX-->>TX: COMMIT (no writes)
    API-->>UI: 200 {newBalance, duplicate: true}
    end

    rect rgb(255,200,200)
    Note over UI,T: Concurrent Race (DB enforced)
    UI->>API: Request A (key=K)
    UI->>API: Request B (key=K)
    API->>TX: A: INSERT → SUCCESS
    API->>TX: B: INSERT → UNIQUE VIOLATION
    API->>TX: B: ROLLBACK → re-read original
    API-->>UI: A: 200 {amountCredited}
    API-->>UI: B: 200 {duplicate: true}
    end
